+#
+# W114085 review 2026-09-07T23:16:55Z [P1]: the reader validated each inline
+# review text against its own declared digest and never recomputed the OUTPUT
+# TREE identity, so an account could rewrite a reviewer's words, recompute its
+# own per-file checksums, and keep the frozen output digest it claims to
+# represent. Recomputing that identity needs the canonical form the frozen
+# owner took it in, and a worker in a container cannot import
+# `baton_v12.contracts.canonical` -- so the restricted subset those documents
+# actually use is spelled here and held equal to its owner by conformance.
